an><em>骇人</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-blank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-blank0\" data-check-id=\"type3-blank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type3-blank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n</div><div class=\"fs-type\">\n<div class=\"fs-type-head\"><label for=\"ac-type4-pick\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-type4-pick\" data-check-id=\"type4-pick\"> <strong>坐骑</strong></label> <span class=\"fs-muted\">（马、骡， <input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type4-other\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"…\" autocomplete=\"off\">)</span></div>\n<p class=\"stat-line\">HP 12；护甲 0；伤害 d6+1（<em>近身</em>, <em>近战</em>)</p>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">再选4项：</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-0\" data-check-id=\"type4-0\"> <span>+4 HP</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-1\" data-check-id=\"type4-1\"> <span>+1 护甲（厚皮）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-2\" data-check-id=\"type4-2\"> <span>伤害改为 +2 伤害、 <em>强力</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-3\" data-check-id=\"type4-3\"> <span><em>好斗</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-4\" data-check-id=\"type4-4\"> <span><em>灵巧</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-5\" data-check-id=\"type4-5\"> <span><em>神骏</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-6\" data-check-id=\"type4-6\"> <span><em>沉稳</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-7\" data-check-id=\"type4-7\"> <span><em>机灵</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-8\" data-check-id=\"type4-8\"> <span><em>吃苦耐劳</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-9\" data-check-id=\"type4-9\"> <span><em>鼻子灵</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"起始已勾选\"> <span><em>巨大</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-11\" data-check-id=\"type4-11\"> <span><em>力大</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-12\" data-check-id=\"type4-12\"> <span><em>飞快</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-blank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-blank0\" data-check-id=\"type4-blank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type4-blank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">本能</h3>\n<p>选1。</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>恃强吓弱</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>调皮捣蛋</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>填饱肚子</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>受惊炸毛</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>分心走神</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>撒欢乱窜</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst6\" data-check-id=\"inst6\"> <span>撒腿便追</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">代价</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>选1。</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"ac-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">忠诚</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-0\" title=\"忠诚 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"忠诚 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-1\" title=\"忠诚 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"忠诚 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-2\" title=\"忠诚 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"忠诚 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>玩耍、梳毛、训练与爱抚</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>独处的时光，任它游荡</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>舒适的窝、安逸与充足的食物</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"自行填写\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"beast-of-legend\">传说之兽</h3>\n<p>每次选取传说之兽时，选1：</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend0\" data-check-id=\"legend0\"> <span>它 <em>卓异</em> （见下方「号令追随者」）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend1\" data-check-id=\"legend1\"> <span>它获得 +4 HP 与 +1 护甲</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend2\" data-check-id=\"legend2\"> <span>它生出一种独一无二的能力或特质</span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">备注</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"备注\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">号令追随者</h3>\n<p>当你 <strong><em>指使它做出某个行动、而它照做</em></strong>时，若其任一标签适用，掷 +1 而非 +属性（若它还是 <em>卓异</em>的，则掷 +2）。若无标签适用，掷 +0。若其任一标签会碍事，掷骰带劣势。</p>\n<p>当它 <strong><em>没有得到指令</em></strong> 或 <strong><em>自作主张行事</em></strong>时，由GM决定它做什么、结果如何。</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">加深羁绊</h3>\n<p>当你 <strong><em>付出它的代价</em></strong> 且近来未曾付出过时，它持有 +1 忠诚（上限3）。</p>\n<p>按1比1花费其忠诚，可让它：</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>克服恐惧，照你说的做</li><li>克制住不按其本能/标签/特质行事</li><li>去做它不愿做的事（只要不是伤天害理或自寻死路）</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"loyal-to-the-end\">不离不弃</h3>\n<p>当 <strong><em>你的伙伴降至 0 HP</em></strong>时，掷 +0，若它持有忠诚则带优势： <strong>10+时</strong>，只要恢复任意HP它就没事； <strong>7-9时</strong>，它获得 <em>受伤</em> 标签； <strong>6-时</strong>，它受了伤，若无人相救，不久便会死去。</p>"
}
